+- `tests/acceptance/c0043/rounds.spec.luau` :: "lists every raft once, sorted by id": its expected list walks `rafts`, `rafts/active` and `rafts/done` only, while metrics now also lists the retired R0040;
+- `tests/acceptance/c0005/worktree.spec.luau` :: "a number shared by two prefixes is a warning" (line 336), on a clone where `engine.empty` leaves the retired folder in place.
